Description: USB gadget DVD-ROM storage module (DKMS)
 Out-of-tree kernel module that extends the USB mass storage gadget
 with full DVD-ROM emulation. Adds GET CONFIGURATION (0x46),
 READ DVD STRUCTURE (0xAD) and READ DISC INFORMATION (0x51) SCSI
 commands so that hosts see a real DVD-ROM drive instead of a CD-ROM.
 .
 Designed for Raspberry Pi Zero 2 W (ZeroCD project) but works on
 any ARM64 Linux system with dwc2/UDC gadget support.
 .
 DKMS automatically rebuilds the module when the kernel is updated.

